<title>HONG KONG: Trade in Leung Kee shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trade in Leung Kee shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of construction concern Leung Kee Holdings Ltd was suspended on Monday at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange.</p>
<p>Leung Kee shares gained HK$0.115 to HK$0.51 in late morning prior to the suspension. Volume was 105.89 million shares.</p>
<p>Last month, the company said its substantial shareholders were in litigation which might lead to a disposal of some of their stakes in the company.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
